      "cooked": "<p>If Absolute Zero is prevented from dealing damage.&nbsp; Can he still use his power to heal hitpoints (Assuming Null Calibration Unit is in play)?&nbsp; Either . . .&nbsp;</p><p>1. He does himself 1 cold damage but doesn't deal damage, instead he heals himself 1 hitpoint OR</p><p>2. The damage cannot be done so the damage is 0 and healed hitpoints is 0.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
